1
00:00:02,258 --> 00:00:04,427
KATARA: Water.

2
00:00:04,844 --> 00:00:06,304
Earth.

3
00:00:06,596 --> 00:00:08,598
Fire.

4
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,308
Air.

5
00:00:11,142 --> 00:00:15,104
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,438 --> 00:00:19,275
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,776 --> 00:00:22,403
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,529 --> 00:00:23,738
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,863 --> 00:00:26,699
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

10
00:00:27,367 --> 00:00:29,494
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

11
00:00:29,577 --> 00:00:32,664
the new Avatar, an airbender named Aang.

12
00:00:32,956 --> 00:00:35,166
And although
his airbending skills are great,

13
00:00:35,291 --> 00:00:37,585
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

14
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:38,920
AANG: Oof!

15
00:00:39,045 --> 00:00:42,006
But I believe Aang can save the world.

16
00:00:56,426 --> 00:00:58,970
( COMET ROARING )

17
00:01:04,059 --> 00:01:06,102
APPA: ( BELLOWS )

18
00:01:08,063 --> 00:01:11,232
Zuko, don't worry. We can take Azula.

19
00:01:11,316 --> 00:01:12,567
I'm not worried about her.

20
00:01:12,692 --> 00:01:14,402
I'm worried about Aang.

21
00:01:14,486 --> 00:01:16,613
What if he doesn't have the guts
to take out my father?

22
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,823
What if he loses?

23
00:01:18,948 --> 00:01:20,867
Aang won't lose.

24
00:01:20,992 --> 00:01:22,702
He's gonna come back.

25
00:01:23,787 --> 00:01:25,288
He has to.

26
00:01:41,346 --> 00:01:42,555
( CRUNCHES )

27
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:44,140
( SPITS )

28
00:01:44,265 --> 00:01:46,476
What am I holding?

29
00:01:47,018 --> 00:01:49,104
A cherry pit, Princess.

30
00:01:49,312 --> 00:01:51,439
Correct. And what day is this?

31
00:01:52,232 --> 00:01:53,900
It is the day of your coronation.

32
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:55,735
Yes, it is.

33
00:01:55,860 --> 00:01:57,028
So, please, tell me why,

34
00:01:57,153 --> 00:01:59,114
on the most important day of my life,

35
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:01,783
you decided to leave a pit in my cherry?

36
00:02:01,908 --> 00:02:05,620
It wasn't a decision,
it was just a small mistake.

37
00:02:05,745 --> 00:02:06,955
Small?

38
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:10,125
Do you realize what could have happened
if I hadn't sensed the pit in time?

39
00:02:10,708 --> 00:02:13,503
I suppose you could have choked?

40
00:02:13,628 --> 00:02:17,590
Yes, then you understand
the severity of your crime.

41
00:02:18,258 --> 00:02:20,844
I understand, Princess.
Please, forgive me.

42
00:02:21,469 --> 00:02:22,804
Oh, very well.

43
00:02:22,929 --> 00:02:26,015
Since it is a special day,
I will show mercy.

44
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:29,644
You are banished.
Leave this palace immediately.

45
00:02:32,730 --> 00:02:33,815
What are you all looking at?

46
00:02:33,940 --> 00:02:35,567
I have two feet that need scrubbing.

47
00:02:36,109 --> 00:02:38,319
And make sure you get in between the toes.

48
00:02:38,444 --> 00:02:39,863
I won't have my first day as Fire Lord

49
00:02:39,988 --> 00:02:41,990
marred by poor foot hygiene.

50
00:02:46,911 --> 00:02:50,623
It's weird to say, but the
comet actually looks beautiful.

51
00:02:50,957 --> 00:02:53,751
Too bad the Fire Lord's about
to use it to destroy the world.

52
00:03:19,694 --> 00:03:22,989
SOKKA: We're too late!
The fleet's already taking off!

53
00:03:23,114 --> 00:03:24,991
TOPH: Then we're taking off, too.

54
00:03:25,116 --> 00:03:26,534
- Where's the closest airship?
- It's right―

55
00:03:26,618 --> 00:03:27,702
ALL: ( SCREAMING )

56
00:03:34,542 --> 00:03:35,627
( GRUNTS )

57
00:04:07,158 --> 00:04:09,619
You sent for us, Princess?
Is everything all right?

58
00:04:09,786 --> 00:04:12,080
Actually, everything's not all right.

59
00:04:12,205 --> 00:04:14,249
Do you know how long
it took you to get here?

60
00:04:14,374 --> 00:04:16,084
Uh, few minutes, I guess.

61
00:04:16,209 --> 00:04:18,002
AZULA: Five, to be precise...

62
00:04:18,127 --> 00:04:20,004
In which time an assassin
could have snuck in,

63
00:04:20,129 --> 00:04:22,757
done away with me,
and been on his merry way.

64
00:04:22,882 --> 00:04:24,300
My apologies, Princess.

65
00:04:24,509 --> 00:04:26,928
Is this how you plan
to treat your new Fire Lord...

66
00:04:27,053 --> 00:04:28,930
With tardiness and disloyalty?

67
00:04:29,055 --> 00:04:30,723
The Dai Li would never betray you.

68
00:04:30,890 --> 00:04:33,184
And I'm sure that's just
what you told Long Feng

69
00:04:33,268 --> 00:04:35,770
before you turned
against him and joined me.

70
00:04:37,230 --> 00:04:39,399
- You're all banished!
- But―

71
00:04:39,524 --> 00:04:41,067
AZULA: Goodbye!

72
00:04:46,489 --> 00:04:48,449
Please send in
the next group on your way out.

73
00:05:00,295 --> 00:05:02,213
Shh...

74
00:05:04,841 --> 00:05:06,759
( KNOCKS ON DOOR )

75
00:05:06,884 --> 00:05:08,511
( DOOR SLAMS )

76
00:05:19,230 --> 00:05:20,231
Oh!

77
00:05:24,152 --> 00:05:26,279
( GRUNTING )

78
00:05:35,455 --> 00:05:37,415
( GROANS, THUDS )

79
00:05:44,005 --> 00:05:46,632
- That's how it's done.
- SOKKA: Good work, Toph.

80
00:05:46,758 --> 00:05:48,217
Time to take control of the ship.

81
00:05:48,343 --> 00:05:49,469
Take the wheel.

82
00:05:49,594 --> 00:05:50,678
That's a great idea.

83
00:05:50,803 --> 00:05:53,139
Let the blind girl
steer the giant airship.

84
00:05:53,264 --> 00:05:54,849
I was talking to Suki.

85
00:05:55,475 --> 00:05:57,643
That would make a lot more sense.

86
00:05:57,769 --> 00:05:59,520
What are we gonna do
about the rest of the crew?

87
00:05:59,812 --> 00:06:01,314
Take us down closer to the water.

88
00:06:01,439 --> 00:06:02,857
I've got an idea.

89
00:06:06,152 --> 00:06:08,696
( CLEARS THROAT ) Attention, crew,

90
00:06:08,821 --> 00:06:10,490
this is your captain speaking.

91
00:06:10,615 --> 00:06:13,368
Everyone please report to
the bomb bay immediately,

92
00:06:13,493 --> 00:06:16,788
for hot cakes and sweet cream.

93
00:06:16,913 --> 00:06:20,041
We have a very special
birthday to celebrate.

94
00:06:26,839 --> 00:06:29,634
( INDISTINCT CHATTER )

95
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:31,677
Hey, I'm Qin Lee.

96
00:06:31,803 --> 00:06:33,763
I work up in Communications.

97
00:06:33,888 --> 00:06:35,056
Oh, hi.

98
00:06:35,181 --> 00:06:37,016
I work down in the engine room.

99
00:06:37,141 --> 00:06:39,352
That's probably why
we've never met before.

100
00:06:39,435 --> 00:06:40,520
Big airship, you know?

101
00:06:40,645 --> 00:06:42,980
- Uh-huh.
- Yep...

102
00:06:43,106 --> 00:06:45,400
So, do you know whose birthday it is?

103
00:06:45,525 --> 00:06:48,903
I can't believe the captain
remembered my birthday!

104
00:06:49,028 --> 00:06:50,571
He really does care!

105
00:06:50,696 --> 00:06:53,241
CREW: ( SCREAMING )

106
00:06:53,324 --> 00:06:54,867
( SPLASHING )

107
00:06:55,618 --> 00:06:57,912
( ALL GASPING )

108
00:06:59,455 --> 00:07:01,666
Happy birthday.

109
00:07:05,545 --> 00:07:08,131
Fire Lord Ozai, here we come.

110
00:07:27,483 --> 00:07:29,694
Azula, we heard what happened.

111
00:07:29,819 --> 00:07:31,863
Why have you banished all your servants...

112
00:07:32,238 --> 00:07:34,115
...all your Dai Li agents...

113
00:07:34,198 --> 00:07:35,908
...and the Imperial Firebenders?

114
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:37,785
None of them could be trusted.

115
00:07:37,869 --> 00:07:40,288
Sooner or later they all
would have betrayed me.

116
00:07:40,746 --> 00:07:42,582
Just like Mai and Ty Lee did.

117
00:07:42,874 --> 00:07:46,335
BOTH: Azula, we are concerned
for you and your well-being.

118
00:07:48,045 --> 00:07:51,507
My father asked you to come
here and talk to me didn't he?

119
00:07:51,632 --> 00:07:54,719
He thinks I can't handle
the responsibility of being Fire Lord.

120
00:07:54,844 --> 00:07:58,347
But I will be the greatest leader
in Fire Nation history.

121
00:07:58,473 --> 00:07:59,849
I'm sure you will.

122
00:07:59,974 --> 00:08:02,226
But considering everything
that's happened today...

123
00:08:02,351 --> 00:08:05,521
...perhaps it's best if
you postpone your coronation.

124
00:08:05,897 --> 00:08:08,316
What? Which one of you just said that?

125
00:08:10,443 --> 00:08:11,652
What a shame.

126
00:08:11,777 --> 00:08:14,071
There's only one way to resolve this.

127
00:08:14,197 --> 00:08:15,865
You two must duel each other.

128
00:08:16,032 --> 00:08:19,160
I order you to fight an Agni Kai.

129
00:08:19,243 --> 00:08:22,038
BOTH: But... We're not Firebenders.

130
00:08:22,163 --> 00:08:24,123
All right, fine.

131
00:08:24,248 --> 00:08:27,084
Lo, you're banished. Li, you can stay.

132
00:08:27,210 --> 00:08:30,254
But, I'm Li. So who is banished?

133
00:08:32,715 --> 00:08:34,800
( VEHICLES RUMBLING )

134
00:08:44,101 --> 00:08:48,231
Ba Sing Se, the Order of
the White Lotus is here.

135
00:08:48,314 --> 00:08:50,149
Here to set you free.

136
00:08:50,399 --> 00:08:52,902
Only once every hundred years,

137
00:08:52,985 --> 00:08:57,114
can a firebender experience
this kind of power.

138
00:08:57,198 --> 00:08:59,992
-( INHALES DEEPLY )
-( COMET ROARING )

139
00:09:13,047 --> 00:09:14,423
( ROARING )

140
00:10:13,357 --> 00:10:15,901
( CRASHING, GEARS GRINDING )

141
00:10:27,788 --> 00:10:29,040
( GRUMBLES )

142
00:10:29,707 --> 00:10:33,044
All right, hair,
it's time to face your doom.

143
00:10:36,756 --> 00:10:41,510
What a shame. You always
had such beautiful hair.

144
00:10:41,636 --> 00:10:43,095
What are you doing here?

145
00:10:43,220 --> 00:10:46,223
I didn't want to miss
my own daughter's coronation.

146
00:10:46,349 --> 00:10:48,434
Don't pretend to act proud.

147
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:50,102
I know what you really think of me.

148
00:10:50,227 --> 00:10:51,937
You think I'm a monster.

149
00:10:52,021 --> 00:10:53,397
I think you're confused.

150
00:10:53,564 --> 00:10:56,651
All your life you've used
fear to control people.

151
00:10:56,817 --> 00:10:59,362
Like your friends, Mai and Ty Lee.

152
00:10:59,862 --> 00:11:01,238
But what choice do I have?

153
00:11:01,364 --> 00:11:02,823
Trust is for fools.

154
00:11:02,948 --> 00:11:05,326
Fear is the only reliable way.

155
00:11:05,451 --> 00:11:07,578
Even you fear me.

156
00:11:07,703 --> 00:11:10,581
No, I love you, Azula.

157
00:11:10,665 --> 00:11:11,749
I do.

158
00:11:15,419 --> 00:11:17,421
( YELLS )

159
00:11:19,215 --> 00:11:21,926
( SOBBING )

160
00:11:31,894 --> 00:11:35,481
( BREATHING DEEPLY )

161
00:11:40,695 --> 00:11:42,488
We're not gonna catch up to him in time!

162
00:11:42,571 --> 00:11:43,698
No...

163
00:11:55,292 --> 00:11:57,336
( FLAMES ROARING )

164
00:12:10,224 --> 00:12:12,101
( BIRDS SCREECHING )

165
00:12:14,937 --> 00:12:16,772
( CHATTERS )

166
00:12:16,897 --> 00:12:18,941
Momo, time for you to go.

167
00:12:19,066 --> 00:12:21,026
( CHATTERS )

168
00:12:21,152 --> 00:12:23,863
( BREATHING DEEPLY )

169
00:12:36,125 --> 00:12:38,169
( ENGINES SLOWING )

170
00:13:19,001 --> 00:13:20,461
What just happened?

171
00:13:20,586 --> 00:13:21,962
It's Aang!

172
00:13:22,087 --> 00:13:23,339
He's back!

173
00:13:38,062 --> 00:13:41,607
OZAI: After generations of
Fire Lords failed to find you,

174
00:13:41,690 --> 00:13:48,656
now the universe delivers you
to me as an act of providence.

175
00:13:49,532 --> 00:13:52,493
Please listen to me.
We don't have to fight.

176
00:13:52,785 --> 00:13:55,579
You have the power to end it
here and stop what you're doing.

177
00:13:55,996 --> 00:13:59,667
You are right. I do have the power.

178
00:13:59,834 --> 00:14:03,170
I have all the power in the world!

179
00:14:03,254 --> 00:14:05,798
( ROARS )

180
00:14:24,108 --> 00:14:25,234
Go, Aang!

181
00:14:25,568 --> 00:14:26,861
Airbending slice!

182
00:14:27,194 --> 00:14:29,446
Shouldn't we be helping him?

183
00:14:29,572 --> 00:14:30,906
The Fire Lord is Aang's fight.

184
00:14:31,574 --> 00:14:33,158
We need to stay focused
on stopping that fleet

185
00:14:33,284 --> 00:14:34,660
from burning down the Earth Kingdom.

186
00:14:34,743 --> 00:14:36,996
And how do we do that, Captain Boomerang?

187
00:14:37,079 --> 00:14:40,124
I can't see outside of
this floating hunk of metal.

188
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,376
Airship slice!

189
00:15:17,453 --> 00:15:21,582
Whoa, that's a lot of fire, isn't it?

190
00:15:43,312 --> 00:15:45,064
SOKKA: It's gonna be a rough ride.

191
00:15:45,189 --> 00:15:47,274
We need to get
to the top of this thing, fast.

192
00:15:47,399 --> 00:15:49,568
( AIRSHIP RATTLING )

193
00:15:49,693 --> 00:15:50,736
Then what?

194
00:15:50,861 --> 00:15:52,363
Watch each other's backs,

195
00:15:52,488 --> 00:15:54,531
and if we make it that far...
I'll let you know.

196
00:15:54,657 --> 00:15:55,824
( KISSES )

197
00:16:00,746 --> 00:16:03,040
( METAL GROANING, EXPLOSIONS )

198
00:16:24,770 --> 00:16:25,813
SUKI: ( GASPS )

199
00:16:25,896 --> 00:16:27,022
( SCREAMS )

200
00:16:27,272 --> 00:16:28,273
Suki!

201
00:16:31,110 --> 00:16:33,737
SUKI: I'm okay! Just finish the mission!

202
00:16:34,029 --> 00:16:35,197
No...

203
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:36,490
Sokka, I think we've gotta...

204
00:16:36,573 --> 00:16:37,783
BOTH: Jump!

205
00:16:37,866 --> 00:16:39,243
( EXPLOSION )

206
00:16:39,618 --> 00:16:40,828
BOTH: ( SCREAMING )

207
00:16:42,538 --> 00:16:44,039
( GROANING )

208
00:16:49,712 --> 00:16:52,881
By decree of Phoenix King Ozai,

209
00:16:53,048 --> 00:16:56,260
I now crown you Fire Lord...

210
00:16:56,677 --> 00:16:58,971
What are you waiting for? Do it!

211
00:16:59,471 --> 00:17:02,099
APPA: ( BELLOWS )

212
00:17:04,393 --> 00:17:06,937
Sorry, but you're not gonna
become Fire Lord today.

213
00:17:08,981 --> 00:17:10,441
I am.

214
00:17:10,941 --> 00:17:13,318
( MOCKING LAUGHTER ) You're hilarious.

215
00:17:13,861 --> 00:17:15,779
And you're going down.

216
00:17:17,114 --> 00:17:19,450
Wait. You want to be Fire Lord?

217
00:17:19,575 --> 00:17:21,660
Fine, let's settle this.

218
00:17:21,744 --> 00:17:23,454
Just you and me, brother,

219
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:25,873
the showdown that was always meant to be.

220
00:17:25,956 --> 00:17:27,124
Agni Kai!

221
00:17:28,417 --> 00:17:30,085
You're on.

222
00:17:32,087 --> 00:17:33,714
What are you doing? She's playing you.

223
00:17:33,797 --> 00:17:35,758
She knows she can't take us both,

224
00:17:35,841 --> 00:17:37,342
so she's trying to separate us.

225
00:17:37,468 --> 00:17:40,054
I know, but I can take her this time.

226
00:17:40,262 --> 00:17:42,056
KATARA: But even you
admitted to your uncle

227
00:17:42,181 --> 00:17:43,974
that would need help facing Azula.

228
00:17:44,058 --> 00:17:45,434
ZUKO: There's something off about her.

229
00:17:45,684 --> 00:17:47,853
I can't explain it, but she's slipping.

230
00:17:47,936 --> 00:17:50,230
And this way, no one else has to get hurt.

231
00:18:02,910 --> 00:18:05,329
I'm sorry it has to end this way, brother.

232
00:18:05,954 --> 00:18:07,206
No, you're not.

233
00:18:53,544 --> 00:18:55,212
( ROARS )

234
00:19:05,681 --> 00:19:07,599
-( THUDS )
-( GROANS )

235
00:19:08,183 --> 00:19:09,685
( GROANING )

236
00:19:24,575 --> 00:19:25,701
( ELECTRICAL ZAPPING )

237
00:19:29,955 --> 00:19:31,039
( LIGHTNING CRACKLING )

238
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:45,345
( GASPING, GROANING )

239
00:19:45,470 --> 00:19:46,805
( SCREAMS )

240
00:19:55,772 --> 00:19:57,232
-( GROANS )
- Hmm...

241
00:20:10,829 --> 00:20:12,915
( GASPING )

242
00:20:58,001 --> 00:20:59,795
( PANTING )

243
00:21:32,035 --> 00:21:33,036
( GROANS )

244
00:21:33,537 --> 00:21:35,747
( GRUNTING )

245
00:21:36,873 --> 00:21:38,458
( PANTING )

246
00:21:38,583 --> 00:21:39,918
No lightning today?

247
00:21:40,043 --> 00:21:42,296
What's the matter?
Afraid I'll redirect it?

248
00:21:42,462 --> 00:21:45,590
Oh, I'll show you lightning!

249
00:21:45,924 --> 00:21:47,259
( THUNDER CRASHING )

250
00:21:47,634 --> 00:21:49,678
( INHALING DEEPLY )

251
00:21:49,803 --> 00:21:51,763
( ELECTRICAL ZAPPING )

252
00:21:58,937 --> 00:22:01,023
( LIGHTNING CRACKLING )

253
00:22:07,571 --> 00:22:09,406
No!

254
00:22:18,165 --> 00:22:20,042
( THUNDER CRASHING )

255
00:22:20,584 --> 00:22:23,128
-( ELECTRICITY ZAPPING )
-( GROANING )

256
00:22:23,420 --> 00:22:24,671
Zuko!

257
00:22:24,796 --> 00:22:26,173
( LIGHTNING CRACKLES )

258
00:22:26,590 --> 00:22:29,801
( LAUGHING MANIACALLY )

259
00:22:39,394 --> 00:22:40,562
( GRUNTS )

260
00:22:42,314 --> 00:22:44,858
( LAUGHING ) You're weak!

261
00:22:44,983 --> 00:22:46,818
Just like the rest of your people!

262
00:22:46,943 --> 00:22:51,031
They did not deserve to exist
